#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""drill — a terminal game for learning C++ by writing C++.

One rep: an ~8-line concept card, one prediction question, then a code
drill checked by the real compiler on every save. Escalating hints, a
progress streak, and a staged capstone at the end of the module.

    ./drill            resume: next incomplete lesson
    ./drill 7          jump to lesson 7
    ./drill capstone   play the module capstone
    ./drill review     re-practice a few passed drills
    ./drill status     progress map and streak
    ./drill doctor     verify setup and reference solutions

Design: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-04-cpp-drill-runner.md
"""

